%% A visitor's path through the site, from landing to installing a skill.
journey
    title A visitor goes from wow to installed skill
    section Land
      Read the hero, see the live catalog search: 5: Visitor
      Scan the stack marquee and the rules ledger: 4: Visitor
    section Explore
      Open the command palette with Cmd+K: 5: Visitor
      Filter the registry by kind and craft: 4: Visitor
      Open a skill detail page: 5: Visitor
    section Decide
      Compare two entries side by side: 4: Visitor
      Read the docs on how it is built: 3: Visitor
    section Act
      Copy the install command: 5: Visitor
      Open the source link on GitHub: 5: Visitor
      Install the site as a PWA on mobile: 4: Visitor
